WEBVTT

00:00:07.720 --> 00:00:09.690
Light and Darkness.

00:00:09.690 --> 00:00:12.540
The final battle of the gods
climaxed in a clash between...

00:00:12.540 --> 00:00:17.750
Marfa, Goddess of All Creation,
and Kardis, Goddess of Destruction.

00:00:18.400 --> 00:00:22.550
At the end of their fierce
battle, the stricken goddesses...

00:00:22.550 --> 00:00:27.150
had split the continent,
forming a new land.

00:00:28.090 --> 00:00:31.570
Since then, people have come
to call this new continent...

00:00:31.570 --> 00:00:36.010
"Lodoss - The Accursed Island."

00:02:21.170 --> 00:02:25.190
Having lost its king
in "The War of Heroes"...

00:02:25.190 --> 00:02:27.730
Marmo has been reduced
to chaos and turmoil.

00:02:28.400 --> 00:02:31.940
With their controlling
spells now broken...

00:02:31.940 --> 00:02:33.750
the monsters have
reverted to wild beasts...

00:02:33.750 --> 00:02:37.230
caught in an endless struggle
of survival of the fittest.

00:02:38.080 --> 00:02:40.220
There is no order of any kind.

00:02:40.220 --> 00:02:45.060
The aspect of the dark island had
become as menacing as its name.

00:02:51.660 --> 00:02:52.900
A sacrifice?

00:02:55.150 --> 00:02:57.900
So young a ruler in Lodoss...

00:02:57.900 --> 00:03:01.230
is no match for the power
which slumbers beneath the earth.

00:03:01.940 --> 00:03:03.160
Kardis, you mean?!

00:03:07.040 --> 00:03:09.890
To call forth the bottomless
power which awaits us...

00:03:09.890 --> 00:03:12.440
a High Elf's
life must be offered.

00:03:13.660 --> 00:03:19.130
Do you think Ashram can gain
Lodoss as things stand now?

00:04:16.310 --> 00:04:20.330
Can you really
master it in time?

00:04:23.420 --> 00:04:25.440
Is the Demon Sword
"Soul Crusher"...

00:04:25.440 --> 00:04:27.390
which has been bathed in
the Demon's own blood...

00:04:27.390 --> 00:04:29.790
really so easy?

00:04:32.260 --> 00:04:33.790
What do you want to say?

00:04:34.060 --> 00:04:37.810
Just as the holder of the
Demon Sword rules Marmo...

00:04:37.810 --> 00:04:42.130
he who holds the Scepter
of Domination rules Lodoss.

00:04:44.130 --> 00:04:47.960
Furthest south is a volcano,
Fire Dragon Mountain.

00:04:47.960 --> 00:04:50.840
It is said that Shooting Star,
the demon dragon who dwells there...

00:04:50.840 --> 00:04:53.500
was entrusted with the
Scepter by the Ancient Kingdom.

00:04:53.500 --> 00:04:54.800
Such a thing–

00:04:54.800 --> 00:04:57.820
Is vital to obtaining
Lodoss, is it not?

00:04:59.110 --> 00:05:03.920
He who holds the Scepter
of Domination rules Lodoss.

00:05:03.920 --> 00:05:06.420
You'd do well
to remember that.

00:05:07.170 --> 00:05:09.080
The Scepter of Domination.

00:05:48.950 --> 00:05:49.950
Parn!

00:05:50.500 --> 00:05:52.450
Highness,
it's too much for him!

00:05:52.450 --> 00:05:57.500
Enthusiasm is commendable,
but recklessness isn't!

00:05:57.980 --> 00:05:59.420
Sorry.

00:06:01.880 --> 00:06:03.120
Highness!

00:06:03.120 --> 00:06:06.950
I bring news for
King Kashue of Flaim!

00:06:08.880 --> 00:06:10.390
Out with it, man!

00:06:10.390 --> 00:06:13.350
Highness, Shooting Star...!

00:06:13.350 --> 00:06:14.890
What?!

00:06:53.360 --> 00:06:54.060
Come in.

00:06:59.060 --> 00:07:03.220
The robes of a priestess
of Marfa. They suit you.

00:07:03.790 --> 00:07:05.070
You think so?

00:07:10.740 --> 00:07:13.630
Now Ghim will
surely rest in peace.

00:07:13.630 --> 00:07:15.000
Now then, I should–

00:07:15.000 --> 00:07:17.610
Slayn, are you going somewhere?

00:07:18.430 --> 00:07:19.620
I don't know.

00:07:20.390 --> 00:07:27.050
But I feel in my soul that
it's still too soon for us to relax.

00:07:48.910 --> 00:07:50.740
King Kashue!

00:07:50.740 --> 00:07:52.610
Didn't I say no?

00:07:52.610 --> 00:07:58.520
But the demon dragon is attacking
the people of Flaim, isn't he?

00:07:58.520 --> 00:08:02.020
Exactly, and that makes
it a problem for Flaim alone.

00:08:02.020 --> 00:08:05.020
You have your own path to follow.

00:08:05.020 --> 00:08:05.750
"My own...?"

00:08:06.620 --> 00:08:10.760
Follow your father's path
and gather the Holy Knights.

00:08:11.100 --> 00:08:12.760
But highness...!

00:08:12.760 --> 00:08:16.470
And besides that,
you'll only be in the way!

00:08:18.730 --> 00:08:22.940
Your hesitation during training
proved that well enough!

00:08:35.640 --> 00:08:37.820
How long are you
going to pout?

00:08:45.920 --> 00:08:46.910
Parn.

00:08:47.510 --> 00:08:50.200
You should be glad
you're not going with him.

00:08:51.670 --> 00:08:56.810
Shooting Star is one of Lodoss'
surviving ancient dragons.

00:08:56.810 --> 00:09:00.030
He's a lot stronger than
that other one we fought.

00:09:00.030 --> 00:09:03.680
Hundreds of men together
couldn't beat him.

00:09:20.040 --> 00:09:23.660
He's just worried
about you, Parn.

00:09:23.660 --> 00:09:26.920
I know!
I know, but...

00:09:33.870 --> 00:09:36.830
It's been a while
since we were all together.

00:09:38.210 --> 00:09:40.930
Parn. You're worried
about Wood, aren't you?

00:09:42.040 --> 00:09:44.680
If he is under
Karla's control...

00:09:44.680 --> 00:09:46.690
I should have...!

00:09:49.700 --> 00:09:53.660
Even if he is,
it wasn't our fault.

00:10:50.180 --> 00:10:55.480
He who holds the Scepter of
Domination rules Lodoss, eh?

00:11:01.410 --> 00:11:02.970
Who are you?!

00:11:09.120 --> 00:11:10.020
Impossible!

00:11:12.960 --> 00:11:14.470
I see.

00:11:14.470 --> 00:11:19.920
Your eternal
life requires a human body.

00:11:19.920 --> 00:11:23.240
Apparently any trash will do.

00:11:23.540 --> 00:11:29.250
My name is Karla.
I exist within no body.

00:11:34.520 --> 00:11:38.760
Don't think I will
always be moved by you!

00:11:39.490 --> 00:11:40.760
Kardis?!

00:11:43.830 --> 00:11:49.730
Even a 500-year-old witch is
no match for Kardis the Destroyer!

00:11:53.580 --> 00:11:59.230
Once I resurrect Kardis,
the powers of the gods will be mine!

00:12:00.210 --> 00:12:04.320
Tread carefully this
path you choose, Wagnard.

00:12:06.520 --> 00:12:10.720
The gears have
already begun to turn.

00:12:30.410 --> 00:12:34.510
He who holds the
Demon Sword rules Marmo.

00:12:34.510 --> 00:12:38.900
He who holds the Scepter
of Domination rules Lodoss.

00:12:48.030 --> 00:12:52.300
You'll never make a good spy
if you can't hide your presence.

00:12:52.300 --> 00:12:55.470
I shall be leaving
for a short while.

00:12:55.470 --> 00:12:58.520
What does Wagnard
have you up to?

00:13:09.600 --> 00:13:13.360
I shall be at your side again
before this wound heals clean.

00:13:43.510 --> 00:13:46.750
The capital of Valis, huh?
Gloomy, ain't it?

00:13:47.190 --> 00:13:51.810
Their king is gone.
They'll need time to recover.

00:13:51.810 --> 00:13:54.160
Tell me something
I <i>don't</i> know.

00:13:54.160 --> 00:13:55.520
Looking for someone?

00:13:58.770 --> 00:13:59.770
No, just...!

00:14:16.320 --> 00:14:18.710
Highness, what did
you say to Parn?

00:14:18.710 --> 00:14:20.620
To follow his own path.

00:14:21.200 --> 00:14:22.320
But Parn's–

00:14:22.320 --> 00:14:23.860
This is a dragon quest!

00:14:23.860 --> 00:14:25.290
King Kashue!

00:14:25.900 --> 00:14:28.710
Etoh, look after Fianna.

00:14:50.000 --> 00:14:52.160
Kashue is headed for
Fire Dragon Mountain?

00:14:52.470 --> 00:14:55.450
It would seem that the
illustrious mercenary king...

00:14:55.450 --> 00:14:57.170
requires
the Scepter as well.

00:14:57.170 --> 00:15:00.670
Shall we dispose of this pebble
before he gets underfoot?

00:16:01.380 --> 00:16:03.730
Sir Ashram!

00:16:04.540 --> 00:16:06.060
Don't be so reckless!

00:16:06.060 --> 00:16:09.450
You can't throw your
life away! Our quest...!

00:16:13.140 --> 00:16:17.330
Demon Sword, do you sense
your master has changed?

00:16:17.330 --> 00:16:19.540
Demon Sword of Darkness!

00:16:33.190 --> 00:16:35.340
Parn, the tea's ready.

00:16:36.400 --> 00:16:38.540
King Kashue's left us behind...

00:16:38.540 --> 00:16:42.340
and we don't know where
to start looking for Wood.

00:16:44.420 --> 00:16:46.320
Not like us, eh Parn?

00:16:46.320 --> 00:16:50.890
Not knowing what's to be done.
What we're here for.

00:16:50.890 --> 00:16:52.400
Etoh.

00:17:30.230 --> 00:17:30.820
Deed!

00:17:57.290 --> 00:18:00.640
I'd wondered what challenge
a High Elf would present.

00:18:01.050 --> 00:18:02.640
What do you want of me?

00:18:02.640 --> 00:18:06.790
Your reputation for being
stuck up seems well deserved.

00:18:06.790 --> 00:18:09.740
We should report
to Wagnard immediately.

00:18:09.740 --> 00:18:12.650
No, we'll rendezvous
at Fire Dragon Mountain.

00:18:12.990 --> 00:18:14.650
You don't care
about the consequences?

00:18:15.270 --> 00:18:18.160
Only <i>he</i> is worthy
of our loyalty.

00:18:26.970 --> 00:18:28.170
You!

00:18:28.170 --> 00:18:30.340
I came to pay you back.

00:18:31.180 --> 00:18:33.460
Come on! You're looking
for her, aren't you?

00:18:41.470 --> 00:18:42.580
Deed!

00:18:42.580 --> 00:18:47.060
Wait! It's not impossible,
but don't show your hand yet.

00:18:47.060 --> 00:18:53.230
Two Dark Elf men, one woman.
She's the most powerful one.

00:18:53.640 --> 00:18:57.850
All right. Just
concentrate on saving her.

00:18:57.850 --> 00:18:59.840
We'll handle the rest.

00:19:28.690 --> 00:19:29.640
Damn!

00:19:41.600 --> 00:19:43.450
Why are you after Deed?!

00:19:50.620 --> 00:19:52.110
Hyuri!

00:19:52.110 --> 00:19:52.620
What?!

00:19:53.030 --> 00:19:56.570
That's right, even you
guys are scared of berserkers.

00:19:56.570 --> 00:19:58.480
He won't hold back 'cause
you're a lady, either!

00:20:04.970 --> 00:20:07.810
A retreat would appear
to be in order here.

00:20:12.570 --> 00:20:14.730
Deed! Deed!

00:20:17.230 --> 00:20:18.590
I'm... all right.

00:20:19.220 --> 00:20:24.150
Their spell...
doesn't last long.

00:20:24.880 --> 00:20:26.830
They're...
Fire Dragon Mountain...

00:20:27.170 --> 00:20:28.220
What?

00:20:28.220 --> 00:20:30.870
Marmo... headed to
Fire Dragon Mountain...

00:20:30.870 --> 00:20:33.030
The Marmo are headed <i>there</i>?!

00:20:35.360 --> 00:20:36.890
King Kashue!

00:20:51.770 --> 00:20:55.330
Demon dragon. Wait for me!

00:20:55.800 --> 00:20:59.400
Once I've beaten you and recovered
the Scepter of Domination...

00:20:59.400 --> 00:21:02.860
I will make all of Lodoss mine!

00:21:08.610 --> 00:21:14.370
Shooting Star! This time
your sleep will last all eternity!

00:21:24.500 --> 00:21:27.520
The Marmo <i>and</i> Shooting Star!
It won't be easy!

00:21:28.220 --> 00:21:30.390
I'm going!
To Fire Dragon Mountain!

00:21:38.900 --> 00:21:41.440
Didn't you clear your debt?

00:21:41.670 --> 00:21:46.200
You guys seem like you're headed
for some fun. Right, Orson?

00:21:49.800 --> 00:21:51.990
Thanks for the help back there.

00:21:52.590 --> 00:21:55.100
Didn't expect to hear
<i>that</i> from an elf.

00:21:55.760 --> 00:21:59.510
Don't worry.
From here on, we're with you.

00:22:02.170 --> 00:22:03.510
That's okay!

00:22:03.510 --> 00:22:07.300
Once he's found a path to run,
Parn's not afraid of anything!

00:22:10.820 --> 00:22:13.710
Times change. People change.

00:22:13.710 --> 00:22:16.340
There are those with ambitions.

00:22:16.770 --> 00:22:19.730
And there are those who
struggle to build a future.

00:22:20.310 --> 00:22:23.320
And now, opposing
desires once again...

00:22:23.320 --> 00:22:28.260
move across Lodoss to
clash in a new struggle!

00:22:53.670 --> 00:22:57.350
As ambitions burn,
the fire dragon awakens.

00:22:57.350 --> 00:22:59.520
Within the flaming hell
of Fire Dragon Mountain...

00:22:59.520 --> 00:23:02.770
we face Ashram
in a new battle!

00:23:03.080 --> 00:23:05.230
Next time,
on Record of Lodoss War:

00:23:05.530 --> 00:23:09.180
Episode 10 - "The Demon Dragon
of Fire Dragon Mountain"

00:23:09.180 --> 00:23:11.990
I will defend the peace
of Lodoss with my life!
